  "reason": "Existing evidence shows multiprofile settings improve RNA-only performance (config_005: 0.650 vs config_004: 0.520). Testing image_only with multiprofile (config_011) isolates the effect of profile configuration on image data, which has not been tested yet. This clarifies whether multiprofile benefits are modality-agnostic, addressing a key uncertainty about profile settings' generalizability. It avoids changing multiple factors and builds on prior RNA multiprofile success while exploring image data's potential."
}

